== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: ptwrite [ENC: DEFAULT, MAP: 0F, OPC: 0xAE]
     LENGTH:  4
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: PT
    ISA-SET: PT
    ISA-EXT: PT
 EXCEPTIONS: NONE
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM ACCEPTS_SEGMENT 
  OPTIMIZED: F3 0F AE 20 

== [ OPERANDS ] ============================================================================================
##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------
 0     MEMORY    EXPLICIT       R      MODRM_RM     32      1      32       INT  TYPE  =                 MEM
                                                                                 SEG   =                  ds
                                                                                 BASE  =                 rax
                                                                                 INDEX =                none
                                                                                 SCALE =                   0
                                                                                 DISP  =  0x0000000000000000
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: ptwrite (%rax)
   RELATIVE: ptwrite (%rax)

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: ptwrite dword ptr ds:[rax]
   RELATIVE: ptwrite dword ptr ds:[rax]

== [ SEGMENTS ] ============================================================================================
F3 0F AE 20 
:  :     :..MODRM
:  :..OPCODE
:..PREFIXES
